{"tool_name":"netmage","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"netmage","home":"https://hdpm.biomedinfolab.com","license":"MIT","summary":"A humaN-disEase phenoType MAp GEnerator for the Visualization of PheWAS.\n\nGiven genetic associations from a Phenome-Wide Association Study (PheWAS), a disease-disease network can be constructed where nodes represent phenotypes and edges represent shared genetic associations between pheno-types. To improve the accessibility of the visualization of shared genetic components across pheno-types, we developed the humaN-disEase phenoType MAp GEnerator (NETMAGE), a web-based tool that produces interactive phenotype network visualizations from summarized PheWAS results.","addition_date":"2021-01-18T11:14:08Z","last_update_date":"2021-03-08T13:42:26Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Web application"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:netmage","credit":[{"email":"dokyoon.kim@pennmedicine.upenn.edu","name":"Dokyoon Kim","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Genetic mapping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0282"},{"term":"ID mapping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3282"},{"term":"Network visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3925"}]}],"name":"NETMAGE","owner":"Niclaskn","publication":[{"doi":"10.1101/2020.10.27.357103"}],"topic":[{"term":"Biobank","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3337"},{"term":"DNA polymorphism","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2885"},{"term":"Genotype and phenotype","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0625"},{"term":"Pathology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0634"},{"term":"Personalised medicine","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3577"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"NETMAGE","home":"https://bio.tools/netmage","license":"MIT","summary":"A humaN-disEase phenoType MAp GEnerator for the Visualization of PheWAS.\n\nGiven genetic associations from a Phenome-Wide Association Study (PheWA